1,The Journey Begins...,kjrelations,<p>The basics of the initial site was conceived and a skeleton was implemented! The alpha roadmap was outlined.</p>\n<p>Currently\, this site only offers the classical standard version of  chess while basic functionality is developed and enabled. It will allow for classical games and decision chess games in the future. The following is a list of some major upcoming features and pages. \nStay tuned...                </p>\n<ul>\n<li>A News Page</li>\n<li>A Play Page that interacts with the game</li>\n<li>A Profile Page</li>\n<li>An Account Page</li>\n<li>Enabling Multiplayer</li>\n<li>Revisiting Old Games</li>\n<li>Home Page Lobby and Quick Pair Tabs</li>\n<li>Live Chatbox</li>\n<li>AI opponents</li>\n<li>Theme set selection</li>\n<li>Lobby game filter</li>\n<li>Potential Visual Overhaul</li>\n</ul>,2025-01-13 17:20:08.44-05
2,The Decision Vision!,kjrelations,<p>Next\, the initial planned beta roadmap was considered.</p>\n<p>Once this initial site is complete\, I will begin to create and implement my variant. The following is a list of features coming with the beta version:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Implementing the new variant itself!</li>\n<li>Creating AI and iterating on the design</li>\n<li>Customizing the variant</li>\n<li>Mobile compatibility</li>\n<li>Live games viewing</li>\n<li>Personal Ranking System (ELO)</li>\n<li>Players Page with Leaderboards and Search</li>\n<li>Tools Page with board editor and game search</li>\n<li>Creating\, testing\, and adding sub-variants!</li>\n<li>Many more minor features...</li>\n</ul>\n<p>After these major hurdles and non-referenced other tasks are complete I will wait for feedback that will be added to  version 1.0. \nI have only optional dependent features after it's initial launch but will await feedback and prioritize.         </p>,2025-01-13 17:23:11.953-05
